\b Before you continue\b0\par
\par
This installer does NOT include the FTDI CDM driver that radioberry-juice needs to talk to the Radioberry over USB.\par
\par
FTDI's own driver license only permits redistributing that driver "with the Device" (i.e. by whoever sells the physical Radioberry hardware). This installer is independent software, not a hardware seller, so it deliberately does not bundle or install that driver for you.\par
\par
\b What you need to do, once, before running radioberry-juice:\b0\par
1. Download and run FTDI's own driver installer from https://ftdichip.com/drivers/d2xx-drivers/\par
2. Then continue with this installer as normal.\par
\par
See DRIVER-README.txt (installed alongside the program, and linked from its Start Menu folder) for full details and how to verify the driver installed correctly.\par
}
